 TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-11-01 00:00:00+07'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id, id, amount, created_at, rnk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rnk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id, rnk, created_at;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3) LATERAL cho danh sách khách cụ thể</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ix_txn_cust_time_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn (customer_id, created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INCLUDE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unnest(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[101, 102, 103]::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c(customer_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CROSS JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id, amount, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> txn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-10-01 00:00:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-11-01 00:00:00+07'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at, id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"sql\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Dữ liệu kiểm thử</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn (id, customer_id, amount, created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-02 10:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-03 10:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-04 10:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-05 10:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-31 23:59+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">999</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-11-01 00:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-10 09:00+07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ROW_NUMBER: KH1 -> 1,2,3 ; KH2 -> 5,7 (id 6 thuộc tháng 11)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- RANK:       KH1 -> 1,2,3,4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div>"},{"key":"real","label":"Thực tế trong dự án của tôi","role":"personal","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh</strong> dựng từ các hệ thống dữ liệu, báo cáo trong dự án bạn đã tham gia (vai trò chính của bạn là Angular). <strong>Tình huống điển hình</strong> là tình huống hay gặp với dữ liệu ngân hàng, bảo hiểm do app biên soạn để luyện cách kể; số liệu là ví dụ minh hoạ. Chưa làm trực tiếp thì kể là đã tìm hiểu hoặc luyện, đừng nhận là đã vận hành.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh:</strong> dự án tra soát của ngân hàng A có dashboard tổng hợp khiếu nại; câu top N mỗi nhóm là dạng truy vấn phía sau loại màn này.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đã làm:</strong> luyện <code>ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY ...)</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Kết quả:</strong> kể như bài luyện.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tình huống điển hình:</strong> Bài tập: lấy 3 giao dịch lớn nhất mỗi khách bằng <code>ROW_NUMBER()</code>; khi hai giao dịch cùng số tiền ở vị trí thứ 3, kết quả bỏ ngẫu nhiên một cái. Nếu yêu cầu là lấy cả hai thì dùng <code>RANK()</code>, ghi rõ trong đặc tả. Với bảng lớn và ít khách cần xem, <code>LATERAL</code> kèm index <code>(customer_id, amount DESC)</code> nhanh hơn vì chỉ đọc 3 dòng mỗi khách.</p>\n"},{"key":"followup","label":"Sẽ bị hỏi tiếp","role":"next","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Múi giờ có ảnh hưởng không?</strong> Có — &quot;tháng 10&quot; theo giờ Việt Nam khác theo UTC; ghi rõ múi giờ trong điều kiện hoặc lọc theo cột ngày nghiệp vụ đã chuẩn hoá.</li>\n<li><strong>Trên Spark/warehouse làm thế nào?</strong> Cùng window function; một số hệ có <code>QUALIFY rn &lt;= 3</code> gọn hơn; tránh <code>collect_list</code> rồi sắp trong code.</li>\n<li><strong>Index cho LATERAL có cần <code>amount</code> trong khoá?</strong> Index <code>(customer_id, created_at)</code> lọc tháng rồi sắp theo amount trong bộ nhớ (ít dòng mỗi khách); nếu mỗi khách có rất nhiều giao dịch/tháng, index <code>(customer_id, amount DESC)</code> với lọc thời gian có thể nhanh hơn — đo bằng EXPLAIN.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"traps","label":"Bẫy thường gặp","role":"caution","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong><code>ROW_NUMBER</code> không có khoá phá hoà</strong> — kết quả thay đổi giữa các lần chạy.</li>\n<li><strong>Lọc tháng bằng <code>EXTRACT(MONTH ...)</code></strong> — quét toàn bảng, và lẫn tháng 10 các năm khác.</li>\n<li><strong>Dùng <code>DENSE_RANK</code> khi nghiệp vụ muốn 3 giao dịch</strong> — trả quá nhiều dòng.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"sources","label":"Nguồn","role":"reference","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-window.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PostgreSQL — Window functions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/queries-table-expressions.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PostgreSQL — Table expressions (LATERAL)</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}